Package: potatrip
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: PotaTrip <dweeks@localhost>
Installed-Size: 250000
Depends: python3, systemd
Section: hamradio
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/dweeks/PotaTrip
Description: POTA Trip Planner - Parks on the Air trip planning web app
 Plans multi-park POTA activation trips from a city: filters the POTA park
 database by radius, trip-hours and trip-miles, builds a greedy multi-park
 route that fits the budget (including the drive home), and returns a
 Google Maps directions URL with the parks as ordered waypoints.
 .
 The app is installed under /opt/potatrip with a self-contained python3
 virtual environment, launched via /usr/local/bin/potatrip, and run as the
 systemd service "potatrip" on port 5001.
